(text "3-way FPV analog video switcher, switched from an RC channel" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5e8d8a58-d719-4348-b12f-15c88c2a8411"))
(text "U7 reads the RC pulse: <1300us = CAM1, 1300-1700us = CAM2, >1700us = CAM3 (outputs SEL_A / SEL_B)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 27 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ac99c23a-dc84-433e-8dc6-5027c84e0918"))
(text "U4: IN low = NC (CAM1), IN high = NO (CAM2).  U5: IN high = U4 output, IN low = NC (CAM3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 33 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "99871eef-9fc5-4e81-800c-fcc7bd10cada"))
(text "J1: pin 1 GND, pin 2 +5V from receiver, pin 3 signal.   J6 = AVR ISP: 1 MISO, 2 VCC, 3 SCK, 4 MOSI, 5 RESET, 6 GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 39 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "91c2f4a1-8e30-42dd-be20-9c6a11035c84"))
(text "J2-J4: camera inputs (pin 1 video, pin 2 GND).  J5: video out to the VTX.  Cameras and VTX are powered separately, GND is shared." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 45 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cee8bc8f-033d-468c-bd1c-622703d3be09"))
(text "VBIAS generator: R10, R11, C6 make the 2.5 V DC level for the video inputs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 262 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "856f739b-fa40-4b0c-bbc4-c42ea481a874"))
